  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Distribution",
      "items": [
        "package.json#oscaner is the only hand-written source — emit derives source.json, every harness manifest and the issue forms",
        "emit:check fails CI on any drift, so a generated product is never hand-edited",
        "kairos ships the skills; cdd-engine ships the CLI and its templates to npm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Execution",
      "items": [
        "The engine runs eight commands — implement · review · fix · base · schema · issue · board · init",
        "Every dispatch passes the same gate order first: tree-clean → in-flight → graph → plan-ledger → wave → doc-contract",
        "The child receives a static shell, a frozen return block and one round-context zone, so the prompt-cache prefix stays byte-stable",
        "A plan's task waves are at most three tasks wide — the engine refuses a wider wave rather than splitting it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Judgment",
      "items": [
        "Every dispatched round books a record — the pre-dispatch HEAD, a terminal verdict, the graded violations and the carrier path — even when it is blocked or times out",
        "Completion is a criterion per verb, never the child's exit code: implement owes a commit, review an approving carrier, fix a disposition for every finding",
        "One derivation answers the next hop, and four faces print it: the capsule, the board, the next: line, the pipeline handoff — they cannot disagree"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Convergence",
      "items": [
        "Review findings carry blocker / warn / nit; any blocker routes to fix and a re-review, a one-way hop",
        "A fix that leaves warn/nit only closes as REVIEW_FIX without a re-review; zero findings closes outright",
        "The next: line is the only continuation — a BLOCKED or TIMEOUT round carries none",
        "A plan revision reopens a closed branch line, so a re-review judges the plan the branch review actually bound"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Run state",
      "items": [
        "Round records, per-round logs, the ledger and the handoffs live under .kairos/cdd in the consumer repo",
        "The workspace publishes .kairos/.gitignore with '*' at first dispatch, so run state never dirties the tree the gate reads",
        "CDD documents live under docs/kairos/{overalls,specs,plans}; the engine reads their declared slug identity, not their file names"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
